{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13111330","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13111330","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1311133001:0":{"text":"你们也许很难从这里的断壁残垣中窥见往日此间的模样，成墙的桃花心木书柜，烫金的珍本与手抄本，呼吸间只有墨水的香气。","source_cn":"你们也许很难从这里的断壁残垣中窥见往日此间的模样，成墙...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DB0A66ED6CBD2B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1311133002:1":{"text":"但它们的确存在过。","source_cn":"但它们的确存在过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AE693F5990BB587","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1311133003:1":{"text":"成为亡灵，过了太久的岁月，会慢慢忘记很多事情。","source_cn":"成为亡灵，过了太久的岁月，会慢慢忘记很多事情。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE2D679FCD4B46CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1311133004:0":{"text":"还好，我还记得我的父母……我记得他们很爱我，这座庄园曾是他们送我的礼物。","source_cn":"还好，我还记得我的父母……我记得他们很爱我，这座庄园曾...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14D07E01DF262377","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1311133005:1":{"text":"他们在大厅里挂满了我的画作，一遍又一遍告诉我他们有多为我自豪。","source_cn":"他们在大厅里挂满了我的画作，一遍又一遍告诉我他们有多为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09268967C445189E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1311133006:1":{"text":"我死之后，我的父母将哀思寄托在永寂花里。现在永寂花仍然盛放，我却凝视着他们的坟墓。","source_cn":"我死之后，我的父母将哀思寄托在永寂花里。现在永寂花仍然...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF55F740CC0CAC676","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1311133007:1":{"text":"这就是成为亡灵必须承受的代价。","source_cn":"这就是成为亡灵必须承受的代价。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE56712CA030AFED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1311133008:1":{"text":"永寂花……？","source_cn":"永寂花……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FA0A95716F9CCA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1311133009:1":{"text":"你们见到过，生长在主宴厅里，那些将宴席长桌与画框淹没的白色花朵。","source_cn":"你们见到过，生长在主宴厅里，那些将宴席长桌与画框淹没的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79125D45918D6A00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1311133010:1":{"text":"它们是献给亡者的花。苍白、孤寂，带着淡淡的冷香……和死亡一样，曾经横放在我的坟墓上。","source_cn":"它们是献给亡者的花。苍白、孤寂，带着淡淡的冷香……和死...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD13D615EB0FD2A79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1311133011:1":{"text":"柳博米尔……我明白你的感受。","source_cn":"柳博米尔……我明白你的感受。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF989A806FFD98179","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1311133012:1":{"text":"永远地活着……是恩赐，更是一种诅咒。","source_cn":"永远地活着……是恩赐，更是一种诅咒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70600A606040396F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1311133013:1":{"text":"所以你才带他们来找我？但即便他们明白了又能如何呢，他们活着，我们已死，但无论是谁，到最后都无法逃脱死神的摆弄。","source_cn":"所以你才带他们来找我？但即便他们明白了又能如何呢，他们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AB13EACBDD0C093","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1311133014:1":{"text":"……好了，我们继续吧，这场苦旅仍未结束。","source_cn":"……好了，我们继续吧，这场苦旅仍未结束。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x751886A07074E0E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:柳博米尔":{"text":"柳博米尔","source":"柳博米尔","status":"source"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"满满","source":"满满","status":"source"},"speaker:瓦丽卡":{"text":"瓦丽卡","source":"瓦丽卡","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":3}}